- INDUSTRYNAME: Some industries may have more stable income, affecting creditworthiness.
- PDN (probability of default number): Higher PDN implies higher risk, thus lower credit score.
- UNDERAGECHILDRENCOUNT: More children might imply higher financial burden, possibly lower credit scoring.
- FAMILYSTATUS: Marital status might influence financial stability; e.g., married might have better credit scoring.

